              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Please Hover Here for More Info&quot;' />
              <aliases>
                <alias key='&quot;&quot;' value='PLEASE HOVER HERE TO GET MORE INFORMATION' />
                <alias key='&quot;&#10;&quot;' value='Please Click Here for More Info' />
              </aliases>
            </column>
            <column caption='Incentive Type' datatype='string' name='[incentive_type]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_2773865573765836800]' derivation='None' name='[none:Calculation_2773865573765836800:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[incentive_type]' derivation='None' name='[none:incentive_type:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:incentive_type:nk]'>
            <groupfilter function='union' user:ui-domain='relevant' user:ui-enumeration='inclusive' user:ui-marker='enumerate'>
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;amount&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;bxgy&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;delivery_fee&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;fixed_price&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;free_gift&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;multi_level&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;No Incentive&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;percentage&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;Stacked&quot;' />
            </groupfilter>
          </filter>
          <slices>
            <column>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:incentive_type:nk]</column>
          </slices>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='cell'>
            <format attr='height' field='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Calculation_2773865573765836800:nk]' value='57' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='worksheet'>
            <format attr='display-field-labels' scope='rows' value='false' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
            <encodings>
              <color column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Calculation_2773865573765836800:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>PLEASE NOTE THAT THE TABLE CAN BE EXPANDED BY USING THE + BUTTON NEXT TO &quot;SEGMENT&quot; COLUMN.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>NOTE: PLEASE KEEP IN MIND THAT SELECTING &quot;WEEKLY&quot; MIGHT REDUCE THE PERFORMANCE AND THE VISIBILITY</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>This tab aims to show channel performance on orders/acquisitions/qc trials with different KPIs.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- In this dashboard, </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>only </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>CARC spend is included.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Stacked incentives would be considered as &quot;Multiple Channels&quot; in this dashboard if they&apos;d have different spend channels. Otherwise, we&apos;d assign the order to the relevant channel.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Explanations:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>-</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>iCPGMV</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> (Incentive Cost per GMV): Incentive Cost will include all money spent on the channel while the GMV will be split between the stacked incentives as mentioned above.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>-</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>iCPO (</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>Incentive Cost per Order): Incentive Cost will include all money spent on the channel while the every order which the channel was utilised at least once will be included in the Orders calculations.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>QC Trial</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>: First order of a customer (based on ACID) that is not on a restaurant or courier vertical.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Known Issues:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Due to data quality issues, we can&apos;t identify which party paid for an incentive for every incentive. As a result all incentives can be higher than the sum of DH Funded and Vendor Funded incentives.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- %age columns will work </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>only</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> for the selected incentives (the denominator will be dynamic based on the filters).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- Be mindful of data completeness. Please check the landing page or Incentives Data Availability and Quality dashboard for details.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Calculation_2773865573765836800:nk]</rows>
        <cols />
      </table>
      <simple-id uuid='{365EAA46-B215-4F95-BEDF-B0B07114D0F2}' />
    </worksheet>
    <worksheet name='Info Sheet.FO'>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Incentives HLR' name='federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf'>
            <column caption='Notes.FO' datatype='string' name='[Notes.QoA/QCT (copy)_2773865573769261058]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Please Hover Here for More Info&quot;' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Incentive Type' datatype='string' name='[incentive_type]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Notes.QoA/QCT (copy)_2773865573769261058]' derivation='None' name='[none:Notes.QoA/QCT (copy)_2773865573769261058:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[incentive_type]' derivation='None' name='[none:incentive_type:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:incentive_type:nk]'>
            <groupfilter function='union' user:ui-domain='relevant' user:ui-enumeration='inclusive' user:ui-marker='enumerate'>
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;amount&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;bxgy&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;delivery_fee&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;fixed_price&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;free_gift&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;multi_level&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;No Incentive&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;percentage&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;Stacked&quot;' />
            </groupfilter>
          </filter>
          <slices>
            <column>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:incentive_type:nk]</column>
          </slices>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='cell'>
            <format attr='height' field='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.QoA/QCT (copy)_2773865573769261058:nk]' value='55' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='worksheet'>
            <format attr='display-field-labels' scope='rows' value='false' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
            <encodings>
              <color column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.QoA/QCT (copy)_2773865573769261058:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>NOTE: PLEASE KEEP IN MIND THAT SELECTING &quot;WEEKLY&quot; MIGHT REDUCE THE PERFORMANCE AND THE VISIBILITY</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>In this tab, we would like to analyse how the incentives are used. This can help us identify fraudulent usages or fraud patterns.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- During the calculation of the bins, it is first checked if a customer turned into a zombie or not. This is checked for first acquisition and then trial. Then if they have multiple accounts or not. Then the percentage of incentivised orders are checked.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- In this dashboard, DH Funded Incentives are limited to the CARC incentives. When incentives from all sources (Vendors, Third Party) selected, DH Funded Incentives are still limited to the CARC incentives.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Explanations:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>Activity</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>: Orders from a bin </run>
                <run fontsize='9' italic='true'>divided by </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>Customers that belong to that bin.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>QC Trial</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>: First order of an ACID that is not on a restaurant or courier vertical. A </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>QC Trial</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> can only happen at one vertical, either Local Shops or Dmarts. We will not calculate a trial for first order in each vertical.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Known Issues:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- A customer can belong to multiple bins but the bins are defined mutually exclusive. This is explained above.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Spend by all funding sources are roughly 5% missing. This is due to the missing data quality. The percentage might increase or decrease depending on the entity. Please see &quot;CI Data Availability&quot;in the  Data Availability and Quality dashboard.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- Be mindful of data completeness. Please check the landing page or Incentives Data Availability and Quality dashboard for details.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.QoA/QCT (copy)_2773865573769261058:nk]</rows>
        <cols />
      </table>
