              <color column='[federated.1lyipm9007npkg1h4cy2m1525r1j].[none:Calculation_6162965031984644103:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>In this tab, we aim to present the main KPIs of RDF Framework over time enabling the users to compare two entities / verticals etc.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>- All calculations are made using the Reach/Depth/Frequency framework. Please check the details of framework.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>- In this tab, there is a parameter to define which incentives are included in the analysis.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Explanations:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>CARC Only</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>: Includes DH Incentive spend excluding different incentive types such as Long-Term DF Incentives or Employee Benefits. Please see related documentation for details.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>LT DF + CARCwithoutCC</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>: CARC Spend + Long Term Delivery Fee Incentives - Customer Compensation (Auto/Manual). Please keep in mind that starting from 2022, CC will be out of CARC so there will be no need for deduction.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Known Issues:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- Be mindful of data completeness. Please check the landing page or Incentives Data Availability and Quality dashboard for details.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows>[federated.1lyipm9007npkg1h4cy2m1525r1j].[none:Calculation_6162965031984644103:nk]</rows>
        <cols />
      </table>
