            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>In this tab, we aim to present an overview to the Reach/Depth/Frequency frameworks&apos; main KPIs per entity. Please be aware that results are presented monthly or weekly.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
