              <color column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Calculation_6932587993011761153:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>This tab aims to present an overview of incentives with two main KPIs (Spending and Orders) and two main splits (Verticals and Funding).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- In this dashboard, </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>only </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>CARC spend is included.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Explanations:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Due to missing data, we can&apos;t identify who paid for each incentive, unidentified incentives are stored under </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>Missing Data</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Some of the incentives are without any incentive cost. These are known to be </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>Activation </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>incentives.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- Be mindful of data completeness. Please check the landing page or Incentives Data Availability and Quality dashboard for details.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
